{"pin":"BH01554","subcodes":[{"code":"BH01554","anchor":"","first_line":"The supplication of this evanescent one before that divine Phoenix of fire is this - that, praise be to God, in every missive wafted the sweet-scented breaths [3.5s]... ...Huququ'llah is indeed a great law. It is incumbent upon all to make this offering, because it is the source of grace, abundance, and of all good","first_line_orig":"عرض این فانی خدمت سمندر نار الهی آنکه الحمد لله در هر پوسته از نفحات طیبه  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"560","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"AYBY.190","source":"AYBY","locator":"190","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/AB/ab-199.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#405","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"405","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/142434767"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_HUQUQP#013x","source":"BRL_HUQUQP","locator":"013x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/204045903"},{"kind":"publication","code":"GHA.103ax","source":"GHA","locator":"103ax","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/c/GHA/gha-112.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BPRY.287x","source":"BPRY","locator":"287x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/386518160"},{"kind":"translation","code":"BRL_HUQUQ#013x","source":"BRL_HUQUQ","locator":"013x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/972206565"},{"kind":"translation","code":"COC#1105x","source":"COC","locator":"1105x"},{"kind":"translation","code":"LOG#1032x","source":"LOG","locator":"1032x","url":"http://bahai-library.com/hornby_lights_guidance_2.html\u0026chapter=2#n1032"}]},{"code":"BH01554HUQ","anchor":"huq","translations":[{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"ja","lang_name":"Japanese"},{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"fr","lang_name":"French"},{"language":"ta","lang_name":"Tamil"},{"language":"ko","lang_name":"Korean"},{"language":"hu","lang_name":"Hungarian"},{"language"